# 🛡️ ChatFilter — Advanced Chat Moderation for Paper 1.21.4

A production-quality chat filter plugin built for Paper 1.21.4. Fully GUI-driven with word filtering, auto-mute, violation tracking, staff alerts, and Discord webhook integration.

---

## ✨ Features

- **Word filtering** — block or replace messages containing filtered words.
- **Mute-words** — words that instantly mute the sender, no warnings.
- **Auto-mute** — automatically mute players after a configurable number of violations.
- **Violation log** — tracks every player who has triggered the filter, sorted by most violations.
- **Staff alerts** — notifies online staff in real time when the filter is triggered.
- **Discord webhooks** — sends violation and mute alerts to a Discord channel.
- **Full 54-slot GUI** — manage everything in-game with no config editing required.
- **Bypass permission** — let trusted players bypass the filter entirely.
- **Configurable warn message** — customise what filtered players see.
- **Replace mode** — optionally replace bad words with `***` instead of blocking the whole message.

