## 🖥️ GUI Overview

### Dashboard `/chatfilter`
The main hub showing live stats and navigation to every section.

| Slot | Button | Action |
|---|---|---|
| 10 | Toggle Filter | Enable/disable the filter entirely |
| 11 | 📋 Filtered Words | View, add and remove filtered words |
| 12 | 🔇 Mute Words | Words that instantly mute the sender |
| 13 | ⚠ Violations Log | See who has triggered the filter |
| 14 | ⚙ Settings | Configure auto-mute, warn messages, replace mode |
| 15 | 💬 Discord Alerts | Set up your webhook URL and test it |
| 19 | 🔇 Muted Players | View and manually unmute players |
| 20 | 🗑 Clear All Violations | Wipe the entire violation log |
| 22 | ✚ Quick Add Word | Click and type a word to add it instantly |

### Filtered Words
Paginated list of all filtered words. Click any word to remove it. Add new words via chat after clicking the **Add Word** button.

### Mute Words
Same layout as filtered words but these trigger an **instant mute** regardless of violation count — no warning given.

### Violations Log
Sorted by most violations. Each entry shows:
- Player name
- Total violation count
- Last word that triggered the filter
- Last message sent
- Timestamp of last violation

Click any entry to clear that player's violations.

### Settings
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| Replace Mode | Toggle between blocking the message or replacing bad words with `***` |
| Warn Player | Toggle whether the sender gets a warning message |
| Auto-Mute Violations | Set how many violations trigger an auto-mute (0 = disabled) |
| Auto-Mute Duration | Set how long auto-mutes last in seconds |
| Warn Message | Click to edit the message sent to filtered players |

### Discord Alerts
| Button | Action |
|---|---|
| Toggle | Enable/disable Discord alerts |
| Set Webhook URL | Click then paste your webhook URL in chat |
| Min Violations to Ping | Only alert Discord after this many violations |
| Test Webhook | Send a test message to verify the connection |

### Muted Players
Lists all currently muted players with time remaining. Click any player to unmute them instantly. Shift+click the clear button to unmute everyone.

