## ⚙️ Configuration

`config.yml` is managed automatically via the GUI. Manual editing is supported if needed.

```yaml
discord:
  webhook-url: "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/YOUR_ID/YOUR_TOKEN"
  enabled: false
  colour: 16711680       # embed colour (decimal) — 16711680 = red
  min-violations-to-ping: 1

filter:
  enabled: true
  replace-mode: false    # true = replace with ***, false = block message
  warn-player: true
  warn-message: "&cYour message was blocked by the chat filter."
  staff-alert: "&8[&cFilter&8] &7{player} &ctriggered filter: &f{word} &7| &fMsg: {message}"
  auto-mute-violations: 3   # 0 = disabled
  auto-mute-duration: 300   # seconds

words: []       # managed via GUI
mute-words: []  # managed via GUI
```

