## 🚀 Installation

1. Download `ChatFilter-1.0.0.jar`
2. Place it in your server's `plugins/` folder
3. Start or restart your server
4. Run `/cf` in-game to open the dashboard

**Requirements:** Paper 1.21.4 — no additional dependencies needed.

---

## 🔨 Building from Source

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/ChatFilter.git
cd ChatFilter
mvn clean package
```

The compiled jar will be at `target/ChatFilter-1.0.0.jar`.

**Requirements:** Java 21, Maven 3.8+

